#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: 0341a7b5537a4158ba1438e7a0f4c19e 472107ab1dff4a0ba6685613f93077cb
#: dcf3fe221f6842838a1b9b88296ff8df df9b3737fefc4e2f93cb97123351ec9d
#: e2b3e27e0b5e44d7a27005e87105c56e e6d3a96416104ed28f288f34317031dd
msgid "Camera Control in Auto Missions"
msgstr "自动任务中的相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 357b5750750b4136b662e37751d6cf56 5cba3e18d8b74bfbbcacb021213b497f
#: 63ffea8d070b45a48b97aec759c9c0ea 7a63c3f653894635aef166b28c82e496
#: 7cfa68cf90fe4de5a73b61dc6396fb09 de2f5a5132fb4c2ba9d6102a23004f38
msgid ""
"This article describes ArduPilot's camera and gimbal commands, and explains "
"how these can be used in Mission Planner to define camera survey missions.  "
"These instructions assume a :ref:`camera trigger and gimbal have already "
"been connected and configured <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍ArduPilot的相机和云台命令，并说明如何在Mission Planner中使用这些命令来定义相机航测任务。本说明假设 "
":ref:`相机触发器和云台已连接并配置完毕 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:12
#: 2c8ad21292c146ccb4624e09159b10e8 37b947b6793d4a18b5c8d21a665533db
#: 5334ead4880246f9a5067342c855a18b df00c993f72e4abea68226f32e897312
#: e13e72289ef44ca995f423e8b8f3ae6d f375b02f364642fa835e1d357e9a2146
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:14
#: 45146139102948bf8ffc2ff9838b0f72 57d2553ae6a940bf81f4b14bb52263f9
#: 705fab69b33e47a0960456c4ed8efa87 bab4cc6ddf5a422fa30d60fecd18c0ce
#: e6883261cdf84a4ebcdd7b4afb0e1311 eee1b2c4426741bca93f0f98a197f007
msgid ""
"Planning a camera mission is almost exactly the same as :ref:`planning any "
"other mission with waypoints and events <common-planning-a-mission-with-"
"waypoints-and-events>`. The only difference is that in a camera mission you "
"specify commands to trigger the camera shutter at waypoints or at regular "
"intervals as the vehicle moves. If the camera is mounted on a gimbal, you "
"can also set the gimbal orientation, or make it track a particular point of "
"interest."
msgstr ""
"规划相机任务与 :ref:`规划带航点和事件的普通任务 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events>` "
"几乎完全相同，区别在于相机任务中需指定在航点或飞行器移动到固定间隔时触发相机快门的命令。若相机安装在云台上，还可设置云台方向或使其跟踪特定兴趣点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:20
#: 15d2f57626cf4e2ab5646093375f252f 24581795d8e24d599dc5744e049fc011
#: 347431220b0c4e01981aa009f52f0a9d 8becc2a0f47249e3873da6600715215b
#: c549fe6df9064824bf0bfbdf9d1fa83d deec8fb18b6d4fbd855fd7390ed82403
msgid ""
"For simple missions you can manually specify the required waypoints and "
"camera commands. For more complex paths and grid surveys Mission Planner "
"makes things easy by providing tools to automatically generating the "
"required mission for arbitrary regions."
msgstr ""
"对于简单任务，可手动指定所需航点和相机命令。对于更复杂的路径和网格航测，Mission Planner提供工具，可自动生成任意区域所需的任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:26
#: 29ea452a0348467d8ade23764cd6bc29 430486967c8a4925813c08e3474666b1
#: 4b5e4381aed547f893b21b7e38459f5a 501d54aae501456f8d556f8d9aa76960
#: 576be03934294a91aa4741aa1fe23ebb f88630f153594a8a8ac80ef7d43c58e9
msgid "Camera commands"
msgstr "相机命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:28
#: 0323bf40e8dd4f79a902845f7809b54d 7bbe09b70852419995e2ee31eecea603
#: 86b6c929be204b15a77ae0016eafe5f0 9cf39a41c5da4f4898448c115e4bf33f
#: e889fd47ff8a473baff857e19f21093e eb1fe7bbb1a04c5f9daf7a8fdcc73f59
msgid ""
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` — Trigger the camera shutter at regular intervals."
" This is most commonly used for supporting area surveys."
msgstr "``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` — 以固定间隔触发相机快门，最常用于区域航测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:30
#: 093178f0d8234707bac47b91ac93b30d 0ce28f2645c148cea54e2dd13f5a4be4
#: 1e2ebe6ca9e44bf881f8e5473a97585e aaf518b074c24ee09fd73ad24d82bcbb
#: c2bccfb7baff48c09d1588770c31c8d8 f45e759d82624f04b8b6b3b04916d224
msgid ""
"``DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL`` — Trigger the camera shutter once every time this "
"command is called."
msgstr "``DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL`` — 每次调用此命令时触发一次相机快门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:32
#: 39a15d2fb15a4d4da61188899e771a1a 5241938e934c4d73b811a7340b9002d8
#: 6c2e1cf825884476ba166a3c82749c00 c7664e1232834cf8ac155952da186902
#: c9fe7cbb2a774da694a416c6bb55392d e9f70f116dda44089981c1a2e0808860
msgid ""
"``DO_AUX_FUNCTION`` — allows any :ref:`auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` to be executed from within a mission without setting up an "
"auxiliary switch.  This includes camera start recording, camera zoom, camera"
" manual focus and camera auto focus."
msgstr ""
"``DO_AUX_FUNCTION`` — 允许在任务中执行任意 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`，无需设置辅助开关。包括相机开始录像、相机变焦、相机手动对焦和相机自动对焦。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:35
#: 1ad5d633d32944499c5fa7323181ea34 6dc9e6e6dbc145e7841c195a0c659e10
#: 81297b7d2d4f4baf8147fb0005cff600 b137fe3435ed4c6abf8f6d6a07c08ca3
#: c63dd1ac35b34b6b9abafcd138dee417 cdb07e41009e471da28dc204ad54a9e9
msgid "Camera gimbal commands"
msgstr "相机云台命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:37
#: 063faf634c614e99beab03e8dc3c74bb 1a4f9830354c4be3ac1c25841a735939
#: 3dfe84c700f144719f4c5b97cc9b0398 679e149196ea4d5dbba1dcc5c504c2c1
#: 904096d073b34d9c8b5f391424f7bd7f 9599f2f3a125447d9fddf4f1e258ed30
msgid ""
"If a camera gimbal is used, you can set the camera position (yaw, tilt, "
"roll) or aim it at a specific region of interest (ROI):"
msgstr "若使用相机云台，可设置相机位置（偏航、俯仰、横滚）或将其对准特定感兴趣区域（ROI）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:40
#: 0acd6ae7f9454de695d6446ffa6bdad2 18185aa8948e4efe8f9dcd4a6b08431f
#: 3ed57628784d4bb4b1f42310205c5568 4e746094dd3842d2b51e63a2f9977abb
#: 79412bd79ab64ef788dda26e374cc969 f9d15d2015dd4717a1be668820c3321b
msgid ""
"``DO_SET_ROI`` — Target the camera towards a specified region of interest "
"(position, including altitude)."
msgstr "``DO_SET_ROI`` — 将相机对准指定感兴趣区域（位置，含高度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:42
#: 053e3a283add41e58766defecabaa984 5cf502ce02da4d06aa16549e95efb12f
#: 6793b8480fdb4d608bd9cc2a3fdc17fe d1de47c9afd54277a993ba15cfc68aa0
#: e13286454f744efcbddec0c51b8d3e07 f7cff198c6fd43fd89ded5fc41242c5a
msgid ""
"``DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW`` — Move the gimbal to the desired pitch and "
"yaw angles (in degrees).  Positive pitch angles are up, Negative are down.  "
"Positive yaw angles are clockwise, negative are counter clockwise.   If the "
"\"Flags\" field is \"0\" the yaw angle is in \"body frame\" (e.g. 0 is "
"forward).  If \"Flags\" is \"16\" the yaw angle is in \"earth frame\" (e.g. "
"0 is North)."
msgstr ""
"``DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW`` — "
"将云台移至所需俯仰和偏航角度（度）。俯仰角正值为向上，负值为向下。偏航角正值为顺时针，负值为逆时针。若「Flags」字段为「0」，偏航角以「机体坐标系」为参考（如0为正前方）。若「Flags」为「16」，偏航角以「大地坐标系」为参考（如0为正北）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:43
#: 1841672bf20c4c9baf505e8215076d9d 435d1c0e373b4412ac19739a08a19eac
#: 57d30fbca6b64dbeb8c7268abb483cd0 5953a20ba7914e2fa3bcd06d61df6cc6
#: a72187b19628428c9cb4de0954c181ec edce3d9b4f89455e92742c7e394f7f4e
msgid ""
"``DO_MOUNT_CONTROL`` — Position the gimbal with the specified roll, pitch "
"and yaw."
msgstr "``DO_MOUNT_CONTROL`` — 以指定横滚、俯仰和偏航角度定位云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:47
#: 17a1874335104af999c6b4a6109fbf7d 1ac1073bf8e243f696663a05831e4700
#: 3d6746f8b1bf42c182bd979f454af9ab b066f52f371e4617992449133caf3ea2
#: dc72316c92fb4ad8a723780cbc883d19 e50bf462310f4c36a5e475a758cdcd8b
msgid "Servo and Relay commands"
msgstr "舵机和继电器命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:49
#: 04903bbd735847a2a9420496e0490a6e 73d8b279154e4518b8481dc692d20608
#: 77dc44dfc72242a5a936b3ffcc327b81 80f2022adcaf49d8b2bbb5c2d69f48d4
#: 8ca8f3e743f243059908a52b722da80b e7b62f0f65a94ee4bdcb1d2be0fc3467
msgid ""
"Servos and relay outputs can be connected to hardware and activated during "
"missions using the ``DO_SET_SERVO`` or ``DO_SET_RELAY`` commands, "
"respectively."
msgstr "舵机和继电器输出可连接至硬件，并在任务中使用 ``DO_SET_SERVO`` 或 ``DO_SET_RELAY`` 命令分别激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:53
#: 47a6eab608044a5c9c467a4f1dc8a848 61efbe405da9453ab506d6b99a34bdb1
#: 79ac9683062344a09aa0b8b22088e5cd 9371c0a8f9624453ba87afe9e129c824
#: c58a146ac186492dbe1176e8075b088b f6f648fa893c44728f11c1ddde7c7223
msgid ""
"One possible use for these outputs is to control camera features other than "
"the shutter (for example, to set the zoom level or switch capture from still"
" to video)."
msgstr "这些输出的一个可能用途是控制快门以外的相机功能（例如设置变焦级别或将捕获模式从静态切换到视频）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:59
#: 35da385259e3426b8568accef50726d5 64f8952ca29e4a6f96e7f8fae87d7435
#: 787b4e4077144645abd83032ad6b6b40 917825f2614d43ee80bb02461fe6ab6c
#: df874ca493804216962009086e0a2f8e e67662c3c4ba44b1ae11580ed60e2fac
msgid ""
"The method used to connect your servo or relay to the camera, and what "
"features are accessible, will depend the camera and its supported remote-"
"control mechanism(s) (see the :ref:`Camera Control and GeoTagging section of"
" the Cameras and Gimbals wiki page <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`)"
msgstr ""
"将舵机或继电器连接至相机的方法及可访问的功能，取决于相机及其支持的遥控机制（参见 :ref:`相机和云台维基页面的相机控制和地理标记章节 "
"<common-cameras-and-gimbals>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:64
#: 4b49617d46d34217b42947f9cc27662e 96072fbc7ac84604b73454ea78263c04
#: 9d1b2559b5c54096941c2b5949b5aa46 dab385feeaa04d848ee46076cd1e3639
#: ddcc24de200e4594ba7aa6ae7c92c37c e4404f8421a246dab18a27e2a8f6daa2
msgid "Auto-mission types"
msgstr "自动任务类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:66
#: 778ee721befd4bb3864ad95ce66ab50a 8186cfa321494949973d99160519b660
#: 821e20cb8b5544a7945162b3acfd19b7 b0598224aa3d42a590ed476e4e1c9710
#: baf7d48d8e70453187d2831ccf7c85b9 f73b78555fd046ef9be3f918bb56e307
msgid ""
"Mission Planner supports the following *Auto Waypoint* options. To access "
"these open the *Flight Plan* screen, right-click on the map and select the "
"option from under the *Auto WP* menu:"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner支持以下*自动航点*选项。要访问这些选项，打开*飞行计划*页面，在地图上右击并从*Auto WP*菜单下选择选项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:70
#: 0269d88d09314fdd935619ae9e15441d 1517fba5d0724eef81fe6226d00728fc
#: 490f96077b73403ea6623cd5f5a176ff 61f5c6cd984042faa49fd8e1ddb4e6cf
#: 9c42b9524e784c9bb54da8b400a87f8b eb476245851046c7892f597451e352a8
msgid "**Create WP Circle** — Create a circle of waypoints."
msgstr "**创建航点圆圈** — 创建一个圆形航点序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:71
#: 0ec964d67a3845858bae675a56fea429 1dbfd8f40ee943d69ad5b29360152f23
#: 4c918f2eb0a44bf19acd636a1a64a67a 98721b18357f473c9d830dfc58c4b426
#: b55c8b35ced540779655c50e76647d78 f07136ab1e78473a87e40a5c2a33dd30
msgid "**Area** — Displays the area of the current polygon (if defined)."
msgstr "**区域** — 显示当前多边形的面积（若已定义）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:72
#: 124afdec0db34223908b49e5f70021b6 69b058e958dc422b905c54150ce206b6
#: ada65d9e69244e3292477f4a01b2e0c4 c105d931c6bc45d599447e0d0f4b02a7
#: c48477aa795f49f5bab85b0cdf4daf7f db7432e7acfb4d83a166a1f0110c1d84
msgid ""
"**Create Spline Circle** — A circle where the altitude of waypoints follows "
"a rising spline (relevant to flying vehicles)."
msgstr "**创建样条曲线圆圈** — 航点高度沿上升样条曲线变化的圆圈（适用于飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:74
#: 22d41ce725c74865bc50888ebf586d2f 3b7f207f593c4e3b8423676558160663
#: 7d4fd40c40424213aa0d5e4e4851af77 988674bbde204a50a5150e402dbbb18d
#: adeb5572ff6541e4a911cd1082f1b452 e2b33a6a2d5640fa96d312e7ee7524ed
msgid ""
"**Survey (Grid)** — Automatically create waypoints and camera control "
"commands to survey a specified polygon."
msgstr "**航测（网格）** — 自动创建航点和相机控制命令，对指定多边形进行航测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:76
#: 173800a36ab440cdbe180c51778c331b 5b7fe6baea204596a2393174166286a7
#: 8607a288ed8347c2bc3c63e6b36b0394 b2fce5d086334ab09a119a3c7bbf31db
#: c0fc5cf2067a45d3befaaafc725622e7 deb6967cbe494afeb24c599f9ae2af8e
msgid ""
"**Survey (Gridv2)** — *Under construction!* This is a simpler grid control "
"for creating a rectangular survey area."
msgstr "**航测（网格v2）** — *建设中！* 这是一个用于创建矩形航测区域的更简单的网格控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:78
#: 02d7f4cd272e48f1a0ad44b3ccf7f0a9 1325bda1ef6e409c843296145274e5c3
#: 293317a9d4154876b7cbff7509c7d5a6 ed8e71bb627d400eb48c4a72957bf5b1
#: fcd871a8ac824abfa307aa8bd2fe62bd ff50fe510ac641a780f2a348f76b2513
msgid ""
"**SimpleGrid** — A simple auto-created survey grid. No camera control is "
"defined, so this must be added separately."
msgstr "**简单网格** — 简单的自动生成航测网格。未定义相机控制，需单独添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:81
#: 1945fdb291284df6815053ffa7bfff34 2905fac57800483b8ad07547e39c5b3c
#: 2db5adb62fc44ee78c8638e2fc44913d 5dee42b638a7402ab561ce0405997b45
#: 8fb7ecd8ca82414e968ae64e1e9e63dc b20f94d7248c484ebb7d6bf08f306054
msgid ""
"The following sections include community-provided examples of automatic "
"survey missions."
msgstr "以下章节包含社区提供的自动航测任务示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:87
#: 11fab9d2b1d14ccbbff99016173437fe 1af5ac85fbf24dc7b81d9e6a12091d58
#: 7053d2568f194f428c400d826bc5d64f b4b10a2877c546a9b8ca63c41d96a714
#: dda5db93d641444186bb796cc4231886 f1ead8aa25f84c1f89baedabc5dd418f
msgid "Survey (Grid) Example"
msgstr "航测（网格）示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:89
#: 09b6dae3c06e491abde2c66fc5201c14 488d01bdbd6e4a57b4cf006353c0f370
#: 582b626d38cf4e82b6c9ad92f22f5086 81b790eb874542939e2b9b7aeb47e107
#: d7c565d7470d45a0b2fd1f369600de13 fb8b7b665e3d478f953f2c12da162c55
msgid ""
"Mission Planner's *Survey (Grid)* option automatically defines the waypoints"
" required to cover an arbitrary polygon, and sets ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` "
"on relevant waypoints to ensure that pictures are captured at regular "
"intervals in the vehicle's path."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner的*航测（网格）*选项自动定义覆盖任意多边形所需的航点，并在相关航点上设置 "
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST``，确保在飞行器路径中以固定间隔拍摄照片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:94
#: 25e5cea001db443687c285d4ef4d588b 487b424ce84e49879b0d3408f5c7431f
#: bb8f5e7850e048f2a024b9961a286e71 c08501a2dd214a5fa077698eb6b4c6af
#: c2358cbb869d4f96ae0c07dce258f2bf d0928d60bc6149f886f928cde4a8ac7d
msgid "Open the *Flight Plan* tab"
msgstr "打开*飞行计划*选项卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:95
#: 49eb868f271a4b0f8462586556af129d 6dffa214ba2f4f708d6e6ebd57bacc9a
#: 7cf23c36b89b4e50ab9c9ab17f7b464a 897dafff31584945b0d91d2615f63b57
