#: d595abb862554b8b85a39b5e711cf59f f0c78b9047424dbfa27d140755ee43f0
msgid ""
"After clicking on **Accept**, *Mission Planner* will generate a list of "
"waypoints covering the specified area, and including take-off and landing "
"waypoints. The ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` command is called to set the "
"distance in meters between two camera triggers during your mission. At the "
"end of the mission ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` is called again to set the "
"parameter back to zero (stops capturing images)."
msgstr ""
"点击 **Accept** 后，*Mission Planner* 将生成覆盖指定区域的航点列表，包含起飞和降落航点。 "
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` 命令用于设置任务期间两次相机触发之间的距离（米）。任务结束时再次调用 "
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` 将参数重置为零（停止拍照）。"

